// ---- Keeping your place when a page redraws itself ----
// A tap that redraws the same page must not move it: the page keeps at least
// its old height while it's rebuilt (a short "Loading…" / "Working out…"
// would pull the scroll up), then goes back where it was. Scroll boxes and
// sideways rows keep their place, open folds stay open. Opening another page
// (goToTab) still starts fresh.
