// ---- What you can do now with your Backpack ----
// Each page lists its tracks (a piece / node from its Now level to its Target);
// reachPlan spends the page's Backpack amounts (what the "Amounts from your
// Backpack" boxes count, BAR_HAVE[calcKey]) on them and returns how far each
// track gets. Two ways (calc_state "upgrade_order"): "order" follows the
// owner's stat order (one row = one troop + one stat; the steps raising that
// stat that give the most per item first, then the next row), "best" takes the
